<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 01:38:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>亚洲家族慈善事业比西方“更加亲力亲为”，也更加企业化</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/asian-family-philanthropy-bridgespan-report-hong-kong-jockey-club/</link><description>超过四分之三的亚洲家族慈善机构与政府合作，这与对国家感到“紧张”的西方捐助者形成鲜明对比。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2289643929-e1788683950986.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/asian-family-philanthropy-bridgespan-report-hong-kong-jockey-club/</guid></item><item><title>顶级经济学家警告说，美国债务比看上去还要糟糕，国债收益率不断上升现在已成为“全力以赴的局面”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/us-debt-demand-warning-treasury-long-term-yields-deficit-bond-investors/</link><description>10年期国债收益率最近的异常表现实际上表明“对国债的需求比乍一看要弱”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292573256-e1788718299100.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 19:41:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/us-debt-demand-warning-treasury-long-term-yields-deficit-bond-investors/</guid></item><item><title>印尼火山岛喷发 1558架次航班取消 17万名旅客受影响</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/volcanic-island-anak-krakatau-indonesia-eruption-flight-cancelations/</link><description>喀拉喀托火山岛位于印度尼西亚爪哇岛和苏门答腊岛之间的巽他海峡，周日凌晨 3 点 53 分喷发了 30 秒，大约三小时后喷发了 16 秒。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26249277578739.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:03:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/volcanic-island-anak-krakatau-indonesia-eruption-flight-cancelations/</guid></item><item><title>国会于 1897 年为了“人民的欢乐”而创建了这座公园。特朗普希望将其高尔夫球场改造成举办大型赛事的高档场馆</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/congress-east-potomac-park-trump-golf-course/</link><description>一项针对高尔夫球场改造提出质疑的诉讼称，特朗普政府的重建将违反创建该公园的国会法案。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26244736922072-e1788737478690.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 23:37:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/congress-east-potomac-park-trump-golf-course/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗计划宣布设立一个“禁区”，从美国海军封锁线出发，穿过霍尔木兹海峡，进入波斯湾</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/iran-exclusion-zone-us-naval-blockade-line-strait-of-hormuz-persian-gulf/</link><description>一天前，美国为回应德黑兰向海军军舰发射弹道导弹而袭击了三艘伊朗油轮。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2276029086-e1788736405206.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 23:18:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/iran-exclusion-zone-us-naval-blockade-line-strait-of-hormuz-persian-gulf/</guid></item><item><title>亚马逊货机在迈阿密机场冲出跑道，撞上车辆并起火，造成至少 5 人死亡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/amazon-cargo-plane-runway-crash-miami-international-airport-flights/</link><description>美国联邦航空管理局表示，这架飞机从波多黎各圣胡安飞往佛罗里达州后于下午 2 点左右冲出跑道。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293852643-e1788724370654.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 20:00:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/amazon-cargo-plane-runway-crash-miami-international-airport-flights/</guid></item><item><title>前贸易官员表示，中国的出口冲击正将全球经济推向崩溃点，美国可能不得不收拾残局</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/china-export-shock-global-economic-crisis-overcapacity-growth-model/</link><description>“其结果是工业机器无法停止也无法减速，但由于需求的限制，它无法继续运转。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2275740840.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 23:04:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/china-export-shock-global-economic-crisis-overcapacity-growth-model/</guid></item><item><title>德国另类选择党有望在地区选举中获胜，并可能组建德国自二战以来第一个极右翼州政府</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/afd-alternative-for-germany-party-saxony-anhalt-regional-election-far-right-state-government-world-war-ii/</link><description>德国选择党在萨克森-安哈尔特州的地区分支机构是被国内情报机构列为右翼极端主义组织的几个组织之一。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291877388-e1788725195226.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 20:24:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/afd-alternative-for-germany-party-saxony-anhalt-regional-election-far-right-state-government-world-war-ii/</guid></item><item><title>事实证明，Z 世代并没有放弃事业。劳动力放弃了他们</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/gen-z-disposable-jobs-work-quit-on-generation-osterman-mit-book/</link><description>麻省理工学院的保罗·奥斯特曼在他的同名新书中发现，35% 的劳动力从事着他所说的“一次性工作”。 “我的意思是，这是一个很大的数字。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1234778024-e1787947300694.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 08:01:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/01/gen-z-disposable-jobs-work-quit-on-generation-osterman-mit-book/</guid></item><item><title>随着美国的压力变得越来越难以承受，就连最高领袖哈梅内伊也担心伊朗的经济和“社会凝聚力”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/supreme-leader-mojtaba-khamenei-iran-economy-social-cohesion-us-pressure-inflation-gas-shortage-rial-currency/</link><description>“有必要认真解决一系列经济和民生挑战，例如通货膨胀、失业、价格管理以及商品和服务市场。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2283476002-e1788711950232.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 17:37:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/supreme-leader-mojtaba-khamenei-iran-economy-social-cohesion-us-pressure-inflation-gas-shortage-rial-currency/</guid></item></channel></rss>